**/__pycache__/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.venv
**/venv
**/.next
**/node_modules
**/.DS_Store
**/*.log

# Backend tests that live beside the module they test, under backend/app/,
# which backend/Dockerfile copies whole. Kept out of the image: nothing
# runs them there, and their fixtures hold strings a scanner reads as
# credentials. By the suffix only, never `test_*.py`: a source file may
# start with `test_`, and one did until it was renamed. See
# docs/docs/plans/2026-10-09-tests-beside-the-source-plan.md.
backend/app/**/*_test.py
backend/conftest.py
